OL,3,GNEWSACannabis 'gardeners' jailed over
OL,4,Agrow worth #3m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been jailed after they
OL,7,Fwere caught working as "gardeners" at a
OL,8,Fmultimillion-pound cannabis farm in
OL,9,FBradford.
OL,11,FMore than 20 so-called "growing rooms"
OL,12,Fand 3,000 cannabis plants were found
OL,13,Fwhen police raided a warehouse unit at
OL,14,FStation Mills on Station Road in Wyke
OL,15,Fin July 2025.
OL,17,FThe plants could have produced cannabis
OL,18,Fworth up to #3.7m, Bradford Crown Court
OL,19,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
