OL,3,GNEWSACannabis 'gardeners' jailed over
OL,4,Agrow worth #3m
OL,5,
OL,6,FHoang Anh Vo, 41, and Pham Van Houng,
OL,7,F36, were each jailed for three years at
OL,8,Fthe same court on Monday after being
OL,9,Ffound guilty of producing cannabis,
OL,10,Fwhile their accomplice, 29-year-old Anh
OL,11,FTran, was sentenced to 31 months in
OL,12,Fprison after pleading guilty to the
OL,13,Fsame offence.
